  "details": "I've been playing with the beta SDK. Since I have friends in the main branch, I visit them there. Issue here is, I have multiple avatars that use Ints for outfit swapping. They worked perfectly fine before upload with this SDK's latest release. Now, they stack Ints one on top of the other somehow until I swap in and out of the avatar, showing the true current state it's in.\nI know for a fact it isn't user error, as this is now on multiple avatars and I didn't touch those sections of the avatars.",
